'''Post-Apocalypse''' (終末世界, ''Shūmatsu Sekai'', '''Doomsday World''') is a 3-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.5 Update|Version 7.5]].

==Effect==
Unit Attack UP (Sm): Cats' attack power increases by 10%.

